  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How to submit the pension contributions to the Pension provider?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at 12:26 PM\n\n\t\tUse the direct submission from the Auto Enrollment >> Pension Schemes >> Contribution File. Also, you may download the file and upload at the pension provider website.\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to add a new Pension Scheme\n\nClick here to watch how to download Pension contribution / Employer contribution reports\n\nClick here to watch how to change pension rates\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to submit the pension contributions to the Pension provider?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at 12:26 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p>Use the direct submission from the Auto Enrollment &gt;&gt; Pension Schemes &gt;&gt; Contribution File. Also, you may download the file and upload at the pension provider website.</p><p><br></p><p>Please refer below screenshot for more help.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074219244/original/0wocX4oETdCI2KPYwP7EpWws5Hmmn-7tJg.png?1553600037\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074219244/original/0wocX4oETdCI2KPYwP7EpWws5Hmmn-7tJg.png?1553600037\" data-fileid=\"9074219244\" data-uniquekey=\"1553600028093\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/a19e8146f0c84c05b13e10c31a282300\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to add a new Pension Scheme</span></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/b442cf1a1183402da90df333c16d8cc1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to download Pension contribution / Employer contribution reports</span></strong></a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/c7c4821a1ef446f59ed9b8e395db2abc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Click here to watch how to change pension rates</strong></span></a></p><p></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165697\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165697/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165697\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165697/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165697\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<